  "final_text": "I fixed the bug in the 12-hour time parser, `parse_12h` in `activity/timeparse.py`. It never turned 12 AM into hour 0, so \"2026-03-02 12:10 AM\" was read as 12:10 PM, about 12 hours too late. That made a big gap in the middle of the night session, which got split in two.\n\nThe fix is a single branch: when the time is AM and the hour is 12, set the hour to 0. All 7 tests now pass, including `test_session_across_midnight`. I didn't change any test files."
